    "body": "@zcorpan Do you have a preference on wether to add the explicit non-namespaced mathml a href to the built-in navigating url attribute list, or not. As you say it's already handled so isn't neccessary but being explicit seemed good to me.\r\n\r\nTHere's also the discussion on whether javascript URLs even work inside of `<math><a></a></math>` so perhaps it doesn't need sanitizing. I think it makes sense to strip the javascript: values regardless even if they don't actually execute.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
