    "updated_at": "2026-08-06T12:06:58Z",
    "body": "I think regardless of whether `javascript:` actually navigates for these elements, that it would be good to make the the sanitizer strip the value, hence why I've added it to the list you mention. Though @otherdaniel if you disagree with this I'm happy to discuss it further. Though having said that *all* MathML elements have a href attribute processed per current spec so even with no spec change it'll be removed anyway.\r\n\r\nI'll let my colleague know about the https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/sanitizer-api/sanitizer-javascript-url.html test to update that too if they haven't already in one of their patches.\r\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
