    "updated_at": "2026-08-20T13:33:25Z",
    "body": "> @zcorpan Do you have a preference on wether to add the explicit non-namespaced mathml a href to the built-in navigating url attribute list, or not. As you say it's already handled so isn't neccessary but being explicit seemed good to me.\r\n\r\nIt seems to me it's dead code, right? Maybe it's confusing that it's not there, but that can be solved with a note.",
